From: Codex local compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Port AZH4 Stagefright HEVC branch adjustment

Reason: attempt11.txt:1003-1005 exposed a missing 32-bit library and an unmatched 64-bit signature. Disassembly and Android RELA identify AZH4's ACodec::setupVideoEncoder comparison as MEDIA_MIMETYPE_VIDEO_HEVC; the analogous S22 fork patch NOPs the HEVC-only early exit. Restrict the adaptation to the exact A376B Android16 source profile and fail closed if its reviewed 64-bit-only layout changes.
Files: unica/patches/legacy/customize.sh.
Verification: hash and disassembly review of locked AZH4 lib64, relocation resolves 0x2639a0 to MEDIA_MIMETYPE_VIDEO_HEVC, exact byte signature occurs once, verify NOP disassembly and ensure other donor branch remains unchanged; clean build and media runtime test still required.

